OL,3,ADolly Parton sings Jolene in Welsh in
OL,4,Arecording released after her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new version of Dolly Parton's Jolene
OL,7,Fis set to be released, with parts of
OL,8,Fthe song sung in Welsh by the legendary
OL,9,Fcountry artist.
OL,11,FThe song was recorded before her death
OL,12,Fon 25 August, and is a collaboration
OL,13,Fwith Welsh singer-songwriter Bronwen
OL,14,FLewis as well as Parton's niece, Jada
OL,15,FStar.
OL,17,FIn a seven-decade career, Parton won 10
OL,18,FGrammy awards, sold more than 100
OL,19,Fmillion records worldwide, and wrote
OL,20,Fmore than 3,000 songs.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
