OL,3,ADolly Parton sings Jolene in Welsh in
OL,4,Arecording released after her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe single will come out on 9 October,
OL,7,Fand is the second posthumous release
OL,8,Ffrom Parton - who was of Welsh descent.
